        "Téléradio"
      ]
    },
    "contextual_aliases": [
      {
        "alias": "Radio",
        "use": "dispatch_source_formula",
        "note": "Use for parenthesized or formulaic newspaper source attributions such as (Radio.) or Londres ... (Radio.) when publication date and surrounding dispatch pattern support Agence Radio rather than a broadcaster."
      }
    ],
    "annotation_note": "In 1920s-1940s French newspaper dispatches, isolated source formulas such as (Radio.) can refer to Agence Radio, by analogy with (Havas.) or (Reuter.). Do not treat bare Radio as a generic news-agency mention outside this source-attribution pattern.",
